dtkwebkit (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Support both Qt5 and Qt6 build environments.
  * CMake auto-detects Qt version; override with -DQT_VERSION=5 or 6.
  * Add qt_compat.h shim for QMouseEvent::position()/QVariant::typeId().
  * DTK5 (DtkCore/DtkWidget) and DTK6 (Dtk6Core/Dtk6Widget) both supported.
  * Debian control uses alternative build-depends for Qt5|Qt6 and DTK5|DTK6.

 -- UnionTech Software Technology Co., Ltd.  <dev@uniontech.com>  Tue, 09 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800

dtkwebkit (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * WPE WebKit Qt6 embedding layer for UOS.
  * Features: EGL rendering pipeline, app:// scheme, JS bridge,
    QWebChannel 12-channel adapter, event translation.

 -- UnionTech Software Technology Co., Ltd.  <dev@uniontech.com>  Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
